   "reference": "compare every token with every abusive word of the same length, position by position",
   "candidate_design": "build a trie of the abusive words; for each token keep the set of trie nodes reachable so far, advancing through the child equal to a letter or the children named by a symbol's substitutions, and report the token when a reached node ends a word",
